{"id": "muller", "titulo": "George Müller · Father to the orphans", "inicio": "m1", "revelar": true, "escenas": [{"id": "m1", "titulo": "Halle, 1825", "fondo": "img/fondos/muller/halle_calle.webp", "colorFondo": "#20160c", "elementos": [{"id": "e001", "tipo": "imagen", "src": "img/personajes/jorge_joven/jorge_joven.webp", "personaje": true, "nombre": "George", "x": 312, "y": 275, "w": 416, "h": 660, "rot": 0, "espejo": false}, {"id": "e002", "tipo": "imagen", "src": "img/personajes/beta/beta.webp", "personaje": true, "nombre": "Beta", "x": 882, "y": 285, "w": 437, "h": 650, "rot": 0, "espejo": false}], "guion": [{"id": "l003", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "Germany, 1825. George Müller is 19 and studies at the university of Halle… but he lives far from God.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l004", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "Since childhood he had lied, gambled and stolen. At 10 he was already stealing money from his own father.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l005", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "George, I’m going to a meeting at a house. They read the Bible and pray together. Will you come?", "forma": "globo", "expresion": "", "quien": "e002"}, {"id": "l006", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "A prayer meeting? What would I do there?", "forma": "globo", "expresion": "", "quien": "e001"}, {"id": "c011", "tipo": "eleccion", "pregunta": "What does George do?", "opciones": [{"id": "o008", "texto": "Carry on with his old life", "lineas": [{"id": "l007", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "That is what the old George would have done… but this time he decided differently.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}], "destino": "repetir"}, {"id": "o010", "texto": "Go to the meeting with his friend Beta", "lineas": [{"id": "l009", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "All right. I’ll go with you.", "forma": "globo", "expresion": "img/personajes/jorge_joven/jorge_joven_alegre.webp", "quien": "e001"}], "destino": "seguir"}]}], "salida": {"modo": "una", "pregunta": "", "opciones": [{"texto": "", "destino": "m2"}, {"texto": "", "destino": null}]}, "mapa": {"x": 0, "y": 0}}, {"id": "m2", "titulo": "The prayer meeting", "fondo": "img/fondos/muller/sala_oracion.webp", "colorFondo": "#20160c", "elementos": [{"id": "e012", "tipo": "imagen", "src": "img/personajes/jorge_joven/jorge_joven_triste.webp", "personaje": true, "nombre": "George", "x": 586, "y": 275, "w": 427, "h": 660, "rot": 0, "espejo": false}], "guion": [{"id": "l013", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "In that house, a few believers read the Bible and prayed together.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l014", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "I have studied about God… but I have never talked with him like this.", "forma": "pensamiento", "expresion": "", "quien": "e012"}, {"id": "l015", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "That night changed George’s life. He himself would later say it was the turning point of his life.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l016", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "Lord, I want to really know you.", "forma": "globo", "expresion": "img/personajes/jorge_joven/jorge_joven_alegre.webp", "quien": "e012"}], "salida": {"modo": "una", "pregunta": "", "opciones": [{"texto": "", "destino": "m3"}, {"texto": "", "destino": null}]}, "mapa": {"x": 0, "y": 0}}, {"id": "m3", "titulo": "Bristol", "fondo": "img/fondos/muller/bristol_calle.webp", "colorFondo": "#20160c", "elementos": [{"id": "e017", "tipo": "imagen", "src": "img/personajes/jorge/jorge.webp", "personaje": true, "nombre": "George", "x": 302, "y": 245, "w": 435, "h": 690, "rot": 0, "espejo": false}, {"id": "e018", "tipo": "imagen", "src": "img/personajes/mary/mary_preocupada.webp", "personaje": true, "nombre": "Mary", "x": 879, "y": 285, "w": 402, "h": 650, "rot": 0, "espejo": false}], "guion": [{"id": "l019", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "Years later, George moved to England. In 1830 he married Mary Groves, and in 1832 he became a pastor in the city of Bristol.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l020", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "In Bristol there were many orphans, with no father or mother and no home.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l021", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "I want to open a home for them.", "forma": "globo", "expresion": "", "quien": "e017"}, {"id": "l022", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "And where will the money come from?", "forma": "globo", "expresion": "", "quien": "e018"}, {"id": "c030", "tipo": "eleccion", "pregunta": "How will George get what they need?", "opciones": [{"id": "o024", "texto": "Take out a loan", "lineas": [{"id": "l023", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "No. I will never go into debt.", "forma": "globo", "expresion": "", "quien": "e017"}], "destino": "repetir"}, {"id": "o026", "texto": "Ask people for money", "lineas": [{"id": "l025", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "I won’t ask anyone for money.", "forma": "globo", "expresion": "", "quien": "e017"}], "destino": "repetir"}, {"id": "o029", "texto": "Ask God alone, in prayer", "lineas": [{"id": "l027", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "I will ask God alone. That way everyone will see that he listens.", "forma": "globo", "expresion": "img/personajes/jorge/jorge_orando.webp", "quien": "e017"}, {"id": "l028", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "Then let’s pray together.", "forma": "globo", "expresion": "img/personajes/mary/mary.webp", "quien": "e018"}], "destino": "seguir"}]}], "salida": {"modo": "una", "pregunta": "", "opciones": [{"texto": "", "destino": "m4"}, {"texto": "", "destino": null}]}, "mapa": {"x": 0, "y": 0}}, {"id": "m4", "titulo": "The first home", "fondo": "img/fondos/muller/wilson_street.webp", "colorFondo": "#20160c", "elementos": [{"id": "e031", "tipo": "imagen", "src": "img/personajes/jorge/jorge_alegre.webp", "personaje": true, "nombre": "George", "x": 135, "y": 245, "w": 450, "h": 690, "rot": 0, "espejo": false}, {"id": "e032", "tipo": "imagen", "src": "img/personajes/mary/mary.webp", "personaje": true, "nombre": "Mary", "x": 556, "y": 285, "w": 409, "h": 650, "rot": 0, "espejo": false}, {"id": "e033", "tipo": "imagen", "src": "img/personajes/ana/ana_feliz.webp", "personaje": true, "nombre": "A girl", "x": 1045, "y": 465, "w": 310, "h": 470, "rot": 0, "espejo": false}], "guion": [{"id": "l034", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "Gifts and money arrived without George asking anyone. He wrote down every gift, however small.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l035", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "In 1836 the first home opened on Wilson Street, for 30 girls.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l036", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "Now we have a home!", "forma": "globo", "expresion": "", "quien": "e033"}, {"id": "l037", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "God takes care of you. The Bible says:", "forma": "globo", "expresion": "", "quien": "e031"}, {"id": "l038", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "“A father of the fatherless and a defender of widows is God in His holy habitation.” (Psalm 68:5 · BSB)", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}], "salida": {"modo": "una", "pregunta": "", "opciones": [{"texto": "", "destino": "m5"}, {"texto": "", "destino": null}]}, "mapa": {"x": 0, "y": 0}}, {"id": "m5", "titulo": "Ashley Down", "fondo": "img/fondos/muller/comedor.webp", "colorFondo": "#20160c", "elementos": [{"id": "e039", "tipo": "imagen", "src": "img/personajes/jorge/jorge_orando.webp", "personaje": true, "nombre": "George", "x": 300, "y": 245, "w": 440, "h": 690, "rot": 0, "espejo": false}, {"id": "e040", "tipo": "imagen", "src": "img/personajes/ana/ana.webp", "personaje": true, "nombre": "A girl", "x": 992, "y": 465, "w": 317, "h": 470, "rot": 0, "espejo": false}], "guion": [{"id": "l041", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "More and more children came. In 1849 a large home for 300 children opened on Ashley Down, and more were built later.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l042", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "By 1870, 1,722 children lived there, in five homes. George never asked anyone for money and never went into debt.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l043", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "Father, you know what these children need. Thank you for taking care of them.", "forma": "globo", "expresion": "", "quien": "e039"}, {"id": "c048", "tipo": "eleccion", "pregunta": "When a gift arrived, what did George do?", "opciones": [{"id": "o045", "texto": "Keep it for himself", "lineas": [{"id": "l044", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "No: everything was for the children and for God’s work.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}], "destino": "repetir"}, {"id": "o047", "texto": "Write it down and thank God", "lineas": [{"id": "l046", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "That’s right. He wrote down every gift and every answer to prayer, so that everyone would know that God listens.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}], "destino": "seguir"}]}], "salida": {"modo": "una", "pregunta": "", "opciones": [{"texto": "", "destino": "m6"}, {"texto": "", "destino": null}]}, "mapa": {"x": 0, "y": 0}}, {"id": "m6", "titulo": "A life of prayer", "fondo": "img/fondos/muller/ashley_down.webp", "colorFondo": "#20160c", "elementos": [{"id": "e049", "tipo": "imagen", "src": "img/personajes/jorge/jorge_alegre.webp", "personaje": true, "nombre": "George", "x": 572, "y": 235, "w": 457, "h": 700, "rot": 0, "espejo": false}], "guion": [{"id": "l050", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "In his lifetime, George Müller cared for more than 10,000 orphans.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l051", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "When he was old, in 1875, he began to travel the world. For 17 years he preached in many countries.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l052", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "He died in Bristol in 1898, aged 92. About 10,000 people came to his funeral.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l053", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "“And my God will supply all your needs according to His glorious riches in Christ Jesus.” (Philippians 4:19 · BSB)", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}], "salida": {"modo": "fin", "pregunta": "", "opciones": [{"texto": "", "destino": null}, {"texto": "", "destino": null}]}, "mapa": {"x": 0, "y": 0}}]}